.TH KUMWALL 1 "2026" "kumde 0.8.0" "KumDE Manual"
.SH NAME
kumwall \- wallpaper client for KumDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kumwall
[\fB\-c\fR \fIR G B\fR] [\fB\-i\fR \fIpath\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
kumwall paints a background layer-shell surface on every output: a
solid color, or a PNG image scaled to fill (cropped to preserve aspect
ratio). Run it before
.BR kumbar (1)
so it sits behind the bar on the layer stack.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-c \fIR G B\fR
Solid color wallpaper, each channel 0.0\-1.0. Default: 0.08 0.08 0.12.
.TP
.B \-i \fIpath\fR
PNG image wallpaper, scaled to fill each output.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kumde (1)
